\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">DOC</text><line x1=\"423\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"131\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"423\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"423\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"455\" y2=\"149\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"504\" y=\"98\" width=\"51\" height=\"67\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"514\" y=\"122\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">DOC</text><line x1=\"513\" y1=\"131\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"131\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"513\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"513\" y1=\"149\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"149\" stroke=\"#95b1b9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M610 121 L677 121 m-9 -6 l9 6 -9 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#608ca5\" stroke-width=\"2.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"687\" y=\"59\" width=\"186\" height=\"124\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f0edff\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"707\" y=\"88\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">LLM ANSWER</text><text x=\"707\" y=\"122\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">Grounded text</text><text x=\"707\" y=\"150\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">[source]</text></svg></div><p class=\"rag-caption\">Retrieval finds passages first; the model then generates an answer with those passages as context.</p></div>",
