      "stem": "How do advanced RAG architectures improve retrieval accuracy and answer relevance using hybrid search, BM25, dense retrieval, query rewriting, multi-query retrieval, cross-encoder reranking, metadata filtering, contextual compression, and iterative or agentic retrieval?",
      "tag": "Hybrid retrieval and reranking",
      "answer": "b",
      "options": [
        "Use dense retrieval alone because keyword search cannot add any useful evidence.",
