      "explanation": "<strong>In simple words:</strong> Advanced RAG checks both wording and meaning, then reranks results. This helps find better evidence when the first search is imperfect.",
      "figure": "<div class=\"rag-fig rag-illustrated rag-layer6\" data-scene=\"hybrid-bm25-rerank-loop\"><span class=\"rag-kicker\">6 / VISUAL LESSON</span><h3>Hybrid and iterative retrieval</h3><div class=\"rag-scroll\"><svg class=\"rag-new-diagram-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 240\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Query rewriting leads to parallel BM25 and dense searches, merged ranking, metadata filtering and a repeatable agentic search loop\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"898\" height=\"238\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fcfeff\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"18\" y=\"77\" width=\"157\" height=\"69\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#eaf3ff\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"42\" y=\"108\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">REWRITE</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"128\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">multi-query</text><path d=\"M175 110 H210 V67 H256 M210 110 V159 H256\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#80a9bb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"262\" y=\"41\" width=\"185\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff2e2\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"75\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">BM25 LEXICAL</text><rect x=\"262\" y=\"132\" width=\"185\" height=\"56\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e4f7ee\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"282\" y=\"166\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">DENSE SEARCH</text><path d=\"M447 69 H487 V117 H536 M447 160 H487 V117\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#80a9bb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"544\" y=\"77\" width=\"148\" height=\"78\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f1effe\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"564\" y=\"107\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">FUSE +</text><text x=\"564\" y=\"131\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">RERANK</text><path d=\"M698 117 L753 117 m-9 -6 l9 6 -9 6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#608ca5\" stroke-width=\"2.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><rect x=\"761\" y=\"77\" width=\"119\" height=\"78\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e5f7f1\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"769\" y=\"108\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">FILTER</text><text x=\"769\" y=\"131\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">COMPRESS</text><path d=\"M820 158 V210 H96 V147\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8fb3b8\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/></svg></div><p class=\"rag-caption\">BM25 and dense retrieval complement each other; reranking, metadata filtering and iterative retrieval refine results.</p></div>",
      "technicalExplanation": "<strong>Correct: B.</strong> Advanced RAG combines lexical BM25 and dense search, rewrites ambiguous queries, merges multi-query results, reranks with a cross-encoder, filters by metadata, compresses context and may iteratively retrieve more evidence when needed."
