ct x=\"353\" y=\"82\" width=\"104\" height=\"81\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fff0e5\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"362\" y=\"112\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">UNTRUSTED</text><text x=\"365\" y=\"140\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">source</text><rect x=\"490\" y=\"23\" width=\"390\" height=\"190\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#fffdf7\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"511\" y=\"53\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">MONITOR QUALITY</text><text x=\"507\" y=\"84\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">Recall@K</text><rect x=\"638\" y=\"72\" width=\"208\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e6edf0\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"638\" y=\"72\" width=\"171\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#61b49d\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"507\" y=\"114\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">Precision@K</text><rect x=\"638\" y=\"102\" width=\"208\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e6edf0\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"638\" y=\"102\" width=\"154\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#61b49d\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"507\" y=\"144\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">MRR/NDCG</text><rect x=\"638\" y=\"132\" width=\"208\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e6edf0\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"638\" y=\"132\" width=\"148\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#61b49d\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"507\" y=\"174\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">Faithfulness</text><rect x=\"638\" y=\"162\" width=\"208\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e6edf0\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"638\" y=\"162\" width=\"187\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#61b49d\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><text x=\"507\" y=\"204\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#345a73\">Latency</text><rect x=\"638\" y=\"192\" width=\"208\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#e6edf0\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><rect x=\"638\" y=\"192\" width=\"129\" height=\"13\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#d8a16a\" stroke=\"#a3c7ce\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/></svg></div><p class=\"rag-caption\">Production requires ACLs, prompt-injection defenses, indexing updates, context management and evaluated retrieval quality.</p></div>",
      "technicalExplanation": "<strong>Correct: D.</strong> Production RAG needs access checks before retrieval, prompt-injection resistance, citation and faithfulness evaluation, incremental indexing and context management. Track Recall@K, Precision@K, MRR, NDCG, latency, cost, scalability and drift over time."
